{
  "bookId": "hero-214020",
  "id": "bond-38801",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38801001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "怎么才来，新闻可不会一直等你啊，真是的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "昨晚想到新闻取材太兴奋了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "哼，多亏这次是我们自己调查，没有特定的采访对象。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "今天你必须多陪我调查一会儿，算赔我的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "怎么一副惊讶的表情？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还以为你会说下次就不等我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "唔，你还是实习助手，这也没办法，不过没有下次了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "实习啊……那看样子我们共处的时间还会很长。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "咳咳……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "追新闻要专心！现在只许你想取材的事情！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "作为助手你还有很多要学的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38801013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "这就是记者助手守则第一条，好了，我们快出发！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
